### Jira / Confluence
Use Atlassian MCP tools (`@atlassian/mcp`). Configure in `.cursor/mcp.json`.
If MCP is not connected, guide the user through setup.

### Browser Automation
Use Playwright MCP (`@playwright/mcp`) for all browser testing.
Configure in `.cursor/mcp.json`:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "playwright": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@playwright/mcp@latest"]
    }
  }
}
```
Playwright MCP tools use the `browser_*` prefix (e.g., `browser_navigate`, `browser_snapshot`, `browser_click`).
